#: website/public/showcase/th04/index.html:722
msgctxt "page:showcase/th04/index.html"
msgid ""
"Compiler checks cover the complete bullet-add code section, including this "
"helper. They also compare its MAP contribution and overlapping relocation."
msgstr ""
